    "created_at": "2020-09-25T09:14:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-25T09:14:57Z",
    "body": "IMHO adding weights would be over engineered. Using a simple list as done with the `prompt_order` would be enough. If you're worried about future implementations you could add a wildcard (`*`) at the end of the list that matches all the remaining package files in the default order except those already set. Something like:\r\n```\r\npackage_order = [\r\n    \"composer.json\", # 1\r\n    \"package.json\", # 2\r\n    \"*\" # Match all the remaining packages\r\n]\r\n```",
